Calls \fBfrappe.desk.reportview.get_count\fR.
.TP
\fBget_list(&self, doctype, fields_json, filters_json, or_filters_json, order_by, start, page_length, view, group_by, with_comment_count) -> Result<String, JssError>\fR
Gets a list of documents with complex filters. Calls
\fBfrappe.desk.reportview.get_list\fR. See \fBSYNOPSIS\fR for full parameter
types.
.TP
\fBget_list_settings(&self, doctype: &str) -> Result<String, JssError>\fR
Calls \fBfrappe.desk.listview.get_list_settings\fR.
.TP
