\fBfile_list(&self, folder: &str, limit: u32, extra_filters: Option<Vec<(&str, &str, &str, &str)>>) -> Result<String, JssError>\fR
Lists files in a folder using the resource API.
.TP
\fBget_notifications(&self, limit: u32) -> Result<String, JssError>\fR
Notification logs for the current user.
.TP
\fBget_events(&self, start: &str, end: &str) -> Result<String, JssError>\fR
Calendar events for a date range.
