\fBget_desktop_page(&self, name: &str, title: &str, public: bool) -> Result<String, JssError>\fR
Calls \fBfrappe.desk.desktop.get_desktop_page\fR.
.TP
\fBget_lazy_child_rows(&self, docname: &str, tab: &str) -> Result<String, JssError>\fR
JSS\-specific: loads lazy child table rows.
