\fBWorkflow helpers (typed):\fR
.TP
\fBworkflow_transitions(&self, doctype: &str, name: &str) -> Result<Vec<WorkflowTransition>, JssError>\fR
Returns typed list of transitions for a document.
.TP
\fBapply_workflow(&self, doctype: &str, name: &str, action: &str) -> Result<serde_json::Value, JssError>\fR
Applies a workflow action to a document.
.TP
\fBtransition_to_state(&self, doctype: &str, name: &str, target_state: &str) -> Result<serde_json::Value, JssError>\fR
