.SS AuthEndpoints (trait)
Implemented by \fBRjssClient\fR. Provides static URL builders usable without
a client instance.
.PP
.nf
\fBpub trait AuthEndpoints {\fR
    \fBfn login_url(base: &Url) -> Result<Url, JssError>;\fR
    \fBfn logout_url(base: &Url) -> Result<Url, JssError>;\fR
    \fBfn csrf_token_url(base: &Url) -> Result<Url, JssError>;\fR
    \fBfn get_logged_user_url(base: &Url) -> Result<Url, JssError>;\fR
    \fBfn app_page_url(base: &Url) -> Result<Url, JssError>;\fR
\fB}\fR
.fi
.PP
Each yields URLs such as \fB/api/method/login\fR, \fB/api/method/logout\fR,
\fB/api/method/frappe.auth.get_csrf_token\fR,
\fB/api/method/frappe.auth.get_logged_user\fR, and \fB/app\fR.
.SS ReportBuilder
Built by \fBRjssClient::report()\fR. Chainable filters before executing.
.PP
\fBMethods:\fR
.TP
\fBadd_filter(mut self, field: &str, value: &str) -> Self\fR
Adds a \fB(field, value)\fR filter. Chainable.
.TP
\fBasync run_raw(&self) -> Result<String, JssError>\fR
Runs the report and returns raw JSON.
.TP
\fBasync run<T: DeserializeOwned>(&self) -> Result<T, JssError>\fR
Runs the report and deserializes into \fIT\fR.
.SS ResourceBuilder
Built by \fBRjssClient::doctype()\fR. Builder for document listing with
filters, field selection, ordering, and pagination.
.PP
\fBMethods:\fR
.TP
\fBfilter(mut self, field: &str, operator: &str, value: &str) -> Self\fR
Adds a filter condition (e.g.\fB.filter("status", "=", "Open")\fR).
.TP
\fBfields(mut self, fields: Vec<&str>) -> Self\fR
Selects which fields to return (sent as a JSON array).
.TP
\fBorder_by(mut self, order: &str) -> Self\fR
Ordering (e.g.\fB"creation desc"\fR).
.TP
\fBlimit(mut self, limit: u32) -> Self\fR
Page size. If \fB0\fR is passed, falls back to \fB200\fR with a warning.
.TP
\fBlimit_start(mut self, start: u32) -> Self\fR
Starting index.
.TP
\fBasync execute_raw(&self) -> Result<String, JssError>\fR
Executes and returns raw JSON.
.TP
\fBasync execute<T: DeserializeOwned>(&self) -> Result<T, JssError>\fR
Executes and deserializes into \fIT\fR.
.TP
\fBasync all<T: DeserializeOwned>(&self) -> Result<Vec<T>, JssError>\fR
Automatically paginates with a page size of \fB200\fR, collecting all
records into a \fBVec<T>\fR.
